---
import ContentPageLayout from '../../layouts/ContentPageLayout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../../components/SectionHeader.astro';
---

<ContentPageLayout
  title="Secure Runtime Environment"
  description="Opinionated, secure Kubernetes baseline for business applications. Zero Trust principles, comprehensive observability, and GitOps integration."
  heroTitle='Secure Runtime <span class="highlight">Environment</span>'
  heroSubtitle='Opinionated, secure <span class="tooltip-trigger">K8s<span class="tooltip-inline">Kubernetes</span></span> baseline for business applications'
  ctaTitle="Ready to Deploy a Secure Runtime?"
  ctaDescription="Let's discuss how the Secure Runtime Environment can provide a secure foundation for your applications."
  ctaPrimaryButton={{ text: 'Schedule a Demo', href: '/contact' }}
  ctaSecondaryButton={{ text: 'View All Platforms', href: '/platforms' }}
>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-with-illustration">
        <div class="content-text">
          <h2>Secure by Default</h2>
          <p>Our Secure Runtime Environment is an opinionated, secure baseline for running business applications. We've made the security decisions so you don't have to.</p>
          <p>Built with Zero Trust principles, comprehensive observability, and GitOps integration, this platform gives you a production-ready Kubernetes foundation that's secure from day one.</p>
          <h3>Key Features</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Zero Trust Architecture</strong> - Network policies, <span class="tooltip-trigger">RBAC<span class="tooltip-inline">Role-Based Access Control</span></span>, and service mesh integration</li>
            <li><strong>Comprehensive Observability</strong> - Logging, metrics, and tracing out of the box</li>
            <li><strong>GitOps Integration</strong> - Infrastructure as code with automated deployments</li>
            <li><strong>Multi-Environment Support</strong> - Cloud, on-prem, edge, and air-gapped deployments</li>
            <li><strong>Compliance-Ready</strong> - Pre-configured for common compliance frameworks</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="section-image-wrapper">
          <img src="/images/site/server-racks.jpg" alt="Enterprise server infrastructure" class="section-image" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-with-illustration reverse">
        <div class="content-text">
          <h2>What's Included</h2>
          <p>The Secure Runtime Environment includes everything you need to run secure containerized applications:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Authentication & Authorization</strong> - <span class="tooltip-trigger">RBAC<span class="tooltip-inline">Role-Based Access Control</span></span>, <span class="tooltip-trigger">OIDC<span class="tooltip-inline">OpenID Connect</span></span>, and service account management</li>
            <li><strong>Network Policies</strong> - Zero Trust network segmentation</li>
            <li><strong>Secrets Management</strong> - Secure secret storage and rotation</li>
            <li><strong>Container Security</strong> - Image scanning and runtime security</li>
            <li><strong>Observability Stack</strong> - Prometheus, Grafana, and distributed tracing</li>
            <li><strong>CI/CD Integration</strong> - GitOps workflows with ArgoCD or Flux</li>
            <li><strong>Backup & Disaster Recovery</strong> - Automated backup and restore capabilities</li>
            <li><strong>Documentation</strong> - Comprehensive operational guides</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section-alt dark-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeader
        title="Seamless Bundle Integration"
        description="Your runtime is the foundation — bundles are the capabilities you layer on top"
      />
      <div class="bundle-integration-grid">
        <div class="bundle-integration-card">
          <h4>SOC Stack</h4>
          <p>SIEM, EDR, threat intel, and vulnerability management for full security operations</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bundle-integration-card">
          <h4>DFIR Tools</h4>
          <p>Malware analysis, memory forensics, disk imaging, and investigation platforms</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bundle-integration-card">
          <h4>Productivity Suite</h4>
          <p>Wiki, issue tracker, Git hosting, and collaboration tools for your team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bundle-integration-card">
          <h4>DevSecOps Stack</h4>
          <p>CI/CD pipelines, security scanning, dependency management, and compliance automation</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
        <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 16px;">Each bundle is pre-tested against the runtime for seamless deployment and guaranteed compatibility.</p>
        <a href="/bundles" class="btn-primary">Browse App Bundles</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ContentPageLayout>
